# Line-ending policy. Earned 2026-08-30: a sheriff-mechanism export left a
# Windows machine with CRLF endings and every sheriff assertion failed rc=2 on a
# Linux shell — working code, red gate. Executables must ship LF everywhere.
*.sh          text eol=lf
scripts/pre-commit text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
# Everything else: git's default text auto-detection.
* text=auto
